update_wait.description:
Updating {name} from {installed} to {latest} looks like it will break something you use:

{findings}

Read the release notes and fix this before you update.

update_check.description:
Updating {name} from {installed} to {latest} changes something you use:

{findings}

Read the release notes before you update.

after_broken.description:
This worked before the update and still didn't work 5 and 30 minutes after it:

{findings}

Restart the integration or app, check its release notes, or restore a backup. This repair goes away by itself when everything works again.

confirm.description:
This worked before the update and still didn't work 5 and 30 minutes after it:

{findings}

Go back to the version before? This installs {names} again. An app is restored from the backup the Supervisor took before the update.

update_wait_unproven.description:
Updating {name} from {installed} to {latest} has changes that may matter, but nothing in your setup was found to use them:

{findings}

Read the release notes before you update.

update_check_unproven.description:
Updating {name} from {installed} to {latest} has changes that may matter, but nothing in your setup was found to use them:

{findings}

